      minimumAdvance: pair("새 provenance panel은 package-event-slot roster를 검사 전에 봉인하고 destructive truth panel을 development와 untouched holdout으로 나눈다. electrical parametric test, X-ray imaging, acoustic microscopy, material spectroscopy처럼 failure physics가 다른 네 방법을 각기 별도 standard·operator·software로 운용한다. certificate schema에는 raw artifact hash, package binding, calibration validity interval, common-input edge, signed null, pairwise separator와 independent reviewer를 필수화한다.", "A new provenance panel should seal the package-event-slot roster before inspection and split a destructively verified truth panel into development and untouched holdout sets. Operate four methods with different failure physics—such as electrical parametric test, X-ray imaging, acoustic microscopy, and material spectroscopy—using separate standards, operators, and software. The certificate schema requires raw artifact hashes, package binding, calibration-validity intervals, common-input edges, signed nulls, pairwise separators, and an independent reviewer."),
