    summary: pair("6개 공식 후보를 9개 field와 4개 승격 규칙으로 감사했다. complete empirical separator 0, 단일사슬 calibration support 2, authenticated missingness 0, public outcome-blind nonresponse validation 0이었다. NIST X4의 5개 camera calibration 잔차는 RMS 0.745 °C·최대 0.915 °C로 재현됐지만 independent holdout이 아니다. X16은 실제 expected trigger와 dropped frame을 문서화했으나 slot별 signed null과 channel 간 independence가 없다. NSFG는 outcome 전에 비응답자를 확률추출하지만 all-case paradata가 제한자료다. 두 구현은 15/15·165 field comparison에 일치했고, 네 원리·270-event relay 실험계획을 확정했다.", "Six official candidates were audited over nine fields and four promotion rules. Counts are zero complete empirical separators, two single-chain calibration supports, zero authenticated-missingness candidates, and zero public outcome-blind nonresponse validations. Five NIST X4 camera-calibration residuals reproduce at 0.745 °C RMS and 0.915 °C maximum, but are not an independent holdout. X16 documents expected triggers and dropped frames but lacks slot-level signed nulls and cross-channel independence. NSFG probability-samples nonrespondents before outcomes, while all-case paradata are restricted. Two implementations agree in 15/15 checks over 165 field comparisons, and a four-principle, 270-event relay protocol is now fixed."),
    problemIds: Object.keys(records), connectionIds: [connection.id],
    verifiedFindings: [
      { text: "NIST X16은 16개 동일 부품·250 layer·두 camera·4채널 DAQ·10 μs command를 공개한다.", textEn: "NIST X16 publishes sixteen nominally identical parts, 250 layers, two cameras, four DAQ channels, and 10-microsecond commands.", sourceIds: ["nist_ammt_x16_pdr_2020", "nist_ammt_x16_notes_2020"] },
      { text: "X16은 nonzero trigger에 frame이 대응하고 layer당 5만 frame 이상 중 통상 20개 미만이 손실될 수 있다고 명시하지만 slot별 authenticated null은 제공하지 않는다.", textEn: "X16 maps frames to nonzero triggers and reports typically fewer than twenty losses among more than fifty thousand frames per layer, but provides no slot-level authenticated nulls.", sourceIds: ["nist_ammt_x16_notes_2020"] },
      { text: "X4의 407-byte camera metadata archive SHA-256은 fa2f22ef…1683이며 다섯 measured calibration pair를 포함한다.", textEn: "X4's 407-byte camera-metadata archive has SHA-256 fa2f22ef…1683 and contains five measured calibration pairs.", sourceIds: ["nist_ammt_x4_pdr_2020"] },
      { text: "다섯 X4 잔차는 mean −0.0408984 °C, MAE 0.7051652 °C, RMS 0.7449862 °C, max |error| 0.914554 °C였다.", textEn: "The five X4 residuals have mean -0.0408984 °C, MAE 0.7051652 °C, RMS 0.7449862 °C, and maximum absolute error 0.914554 °C.", sourceIds: ["nist_ammt_x4_pdr_2020", "nist_ammt_x4_paper_2020"] },
      { text: "그 calibration point가 curve fitting과 분리됐다는 근거가 없어 process-temperature holdout accuracy로 해석하지 않았다.", textEn: "Because the calibration points are not shown to be separate from curve fitting, they are not interpreted as process-temperature holdout accuracy.", sourceIds: ["nist_ammt_x4_pdr_2020", "jcgm_100_2008"] },
      { text: "IUCr QARR는 known composition과 123개 mandatory-sample 분석을 제공하지만 participant acquisition·preparation·reduction parentage는 공개 kit에서 완성되지 않는다.", textEn: "IUCr QARR supplies known compositions and 123 mandatory-sample analyses, while participant acquisition, preparation, and reduction parentage remain incomplete in the public kit.", sourceIds: ["iucr_qarr_outcomes_2001", "iucr_qarr_data_kit_1998"] },
      { text: "SAS round robin은 12 SAXS·4 SANS 장비와 247 profile을 보고하지만 full expected roster·explicit null·calibration lineage가 하나의 public graph로 묶이지 않는다.", textEn: "The SAS round robin reports twelve SAXS and four SANS instruments and 247 profiles, but no single public graph joins the full expected roster, explicit nulls, and calibration lineage.", sourceIds: ["sasbdb_round_robin_project_2022", "saxs_round_robin_2022"] },
      { text: "NSFG는 week 10 남은 비응답자를 outcome 이전에 확률추출했지만 all-sampled-case paradata는 NCHS RDC 제한자료다.", textEn: "NSFG probability-sampled remaining week-ten nonrespondents before later outcomes, but all-sampled-case paradata are restricted through the NCHS RDC.", sourceIds: ["nchs_nsfg_nonresponse_2017", "nchs_nsfg_paradata_access_2026"] },
      { text: "엄격 판정은 empirical separator 0·calibration support 2·missingness 0·public nonresponse validation 0이었다.", textEn: "Strict adjudication yields zero empirical separators, two calibration supports, zero missingness candidates, and zero public nonresponse validations.", sourceIds: ["nist_amb_data_management_2023", "jcgm_100_2008", "rubin_inference_missing_1976"] },
      { text: "partial score를 complete로 올리면 calibration 2→4와 missingness 0→1이 되어 metadata 편의가 판정을 바꿨다.", textEn: "Promoting partial scores to complete changes calibration from two to four and missingness from zero to one, so metadata convenience changes adjudication.", sourceIds: ["nist_amb_data_management_2023"] },
      { text: "독립 Python은 네 qualification count와 일곱 calibration statistic을 15/15로 재현했고 field comparison은 165개였다.", textEn: "Independent Python reproduces four qualification counts and seven calibration statistics in 15/15 checks over 165 field comparisons.", sourceIds: ["nist_ammt_x4_pdr_2020"] },
      { text: "첫 11/12 실행, 잘못 기록된 X16 release date와 비이식적 보존 해시는 세 amendment와 원 결과를 삭제하지 않고 보존했다.", textEn: "The first 11/12 execution, incorrect X16 release date, and non-portable preservation hash are retained with three amendments and the original results rather than deleted.", sourceIds: ["nist_ammt_x16_pdr_2020"] },
      { text: "four-principle relay protocol은 180 development·90 holdout을 설계했지만 acquired hardware event는 0이다.", textEn: "The four-principle relay protocol specifies 180 development and ninety holdout events, while acquired hardware events remain zero.", sourceIds: ["jcgm_100_2008", "fawzi_secure_estimation_2014"] }
    ],
