      adjudication: pair("field가 모두 1일 때만 해당 rule을 통과한다. empirical separator는 9개 field 전부, calibration support는 identity·raw·calibration·public bytes, missingness는 identity·raw·roster·explicit null·bytes, nonresponse validation은 roster·selection·later outcome·reference·blind partition을 요구한다.", "A rule passes only when every required field scores one. Empirical separators require all nine fields; calibration support requires identity, raw values, calibration, and public bytes; missingness requires identity, raw values, roster, explicit nulls, and bytes; nonresponse validation requires the roster, selection, later outcomes, reference, and blind partition."),
      primaryMetrics: pair("strict와 permissive qualification count, 후보별 failed field, X4 5점 residual MAE·RMS·max, X16 independent-pair evidence, NSFG public-bound reconstructability, 15/15 독립 비교, actual event denominator", "Strict and permissive qualification counts, failed fields by candidate, X4 five-point residual MAE, RMS and maximum, X16 independent-pair evidence, NSFG public-bound reconstructability, 15/15 independent comparisons, and actual-event denominator"),
      successRule: pair("real exact 승격에는 complete 9-field certificate, blind holdout, independent reference, 모든 truth 쌍의 separator 기준과 독립 구현 일치가 필요하다. 현재는 그 조건을 충족한 후보가 0이라 승격하지 않는다.", "Real exact promotion requires a complete nine-field certificate, blind holdout, independent reference, separator threshold for every truth pair, and agreement from an independent implementation. No current candidate qualifies, so none is promoted."),
      stopRule: pair("file absence를 null로 간주하거나 unknown edge를 independence로 바꾸거나 calibration point를 holdout으로 재명명하거나 restricted nonrespondent를 respondent 평균으로 대입하면 중단한다.", "Stop if file absence is treated as a null, unknown edges become independence, calibration points are renamed as holdouts, or restricted nonrespondents are replaced by the respondent mean."),
