    nextCycle: pair("RC43는 NIST X16 전체 archive를 무작정 내려받지 않고 HTTP range로 ZIP central directory를 읽어 한 development layer의 XYPT command와 MPM frame member만 추출·해시한다. trigger roster와 actual frame sequence를 event-slot로 정렬해 missing 위치·끝부분 집중·압축 index와 진짜 dropped frame을 분리한다. explicit null을 복원할 수 있으면 두 번째 unseen layer를 holdout으로 봉인하고, 불가능하면 어떤 byte-level field가 없는지 확정한다. relay는 실제 부품 구매나 작동 전에 BOM·절연·최대 coil energy·video frame-rate feasibility와 slot-logger dry run을 검증한다. UP-629는 phase inclusion probability와 four-cell outcome roster를 완전 공개한 two-phase survey를 계속 찾되, 없으면 NCHS RDC에 필요한 최소 변수와 disclosure-safe aggregate 판정식을 문서화하고 접근 신청이나 개인정보 처리는 수행하지 않는다.", "RC43 will avoid indiscriminate download of every NIST X16 archive. It will use HTTP ranges to read ZIP central directories, extract and hash only one development layer's XYPT command and MPM frame member, and align the trigger roster with actual frame sequence to distinguish missing locations, end concentration, compression indices, and genuine dropped frames. If explicit nulls can be reconstructed, a second unseen layer becomes a sealed holdout; otherwise the missing byte-level field is fixed. Before purchasing or operating relay hardware, validate the bill of materials, isolation, maximum coil energy, video-frame-rate feasibility, and a slot-logger dry run. For UP-629, continue searching for a two-phase survey that fully publishes phase inclusion probabilities and the four-cell outcome roster; if none exists, document only the minimum NCHS RDC variables and disclosure-safe aggregate adjudicand without submitting an access request or processing personal data."),
